      "sourceTextSha256": "effbabe7a7b4d371ad3606a6d083de8717545300cf32f0fb7fa202600806a8f3",
      "text": "Travel through Quito, the equator, Quilotoa, Baños, Riobamba, the Chimborazo reserve, Ingapirca, Cuenca and Guayaquil before continuing to the Galápagos Islands. On the mainland, explore cities, Andean landscapes, volcanoes and waterfalls, and discover archaeological sites, cacao and local crafts. In the Galápagos, the itinerary includes Santa Cruz and Bartolomé, plus a boat excursion to either North Seymour or South Plaza Island.",
